      "head": "{\"kind\":\"artifact\",\"artifact\":{\"title\":\"Stochastic Gradient Descent on a Loss Bowl: Learning Rate and Batch Size\",\"description\":\"A blue bowl-shaped surface shows the loss for two model settings, x (left to right, the steep direction) and z (front to back, the gentle direction). The lowest point is marked at the centre. A red ball starts near the back rim. At each step it moves by learning rate times a noisy slope estimate. An orange trail marks every step, up to 40. A purple arrow shows the next mini-batch step, and a dark arrow shows the step the full data set would give. A faded blue ghost can keep the last run's path.\",\"experience\":\"experiment\",\"behavior\":\"rules\",\"controlProfile\":\"inspect\",\"stepped\":true,\"scene\":{\"materials\":[{\"id\":\"bowlBlue\",\"color\":\"#8aa4c8\"},{\"id\":\"ballRed\",\"color\":\"#d23c2a\"},{\"id\":\"pathOrange\",\"color\":\"#e8731a\"},{\"id\":\"keptBlue\",\"color\":\"#1f3a7a\"},{\"id\":\"stepPurple\",\"color\":\"#7b2fbf\"},{\"id\":\"fullDark\",\"color\":\"#2f3640\"}],\"geometries\":[{\"id\":\"bowlGrid\",\"kind\":\"surface\",\"width\":4.8,\"depth\":4.8,\"contours\":8,\"heights\":[[3.6,3.14,2.72,2.34,2,1.7,1.44,1.22,1.04,0.9,0.8,0.74,0.72,0.74,0.8,0.9,1.04,1.22,1.44,1.7,2,2.34,2.72,3.14,3.6],[3.485,3.025,2.605,2.225,1.885,1.585,1.325,1.105,0.925,0.785,0.685,0.625,0.605,0.625,0.685,0.785,0.925,1.105,1.325,1.585,1.885,2.225,2.605,3.025,3.485],[3.38,2.92,2.5,2.12,1.78,1.48,1.22,1,0.82,0.68,0.58,0.52,0.5,0.52,0.58,0.68,0.82,1,1.22,1.48,1.78,2.12,2.5,2.92,3.38],[3.285,2.825,2.405,2.025,1.685,1.385,1.125,0.905,0.725,0.585,0.485,0.425,0.405,0.425,0.485,0.585,0.725,0.905,1.125,1.385,1.685,2.025,2.405,2.825,3.285],[3.2,2.74,2.32,1.94,1.6,1.3,1.04,0.82,0.64,0.5,0.4,0.34,0.32,0.34,0.4,0.5,0.64,0.82,1.04,1.3,1.6,1.94,2.32,2.74,3.2],[3.125,2.665,2.245,1.865,1.525,1.225,0.965,0.745,0.565,0.425,0.325,0.265,0.245,0.265,0.325,0.425,0.565,0.745,0.965,1.225,1.525,1.865,2.245,2.665,3.125],[3.06,2.6,2.18,1.8,1.46,1.16